Module 9: LOLBins

LOLBins = Living Off The Land Binaries

Attackers abuse trusted Windows tools.

Examples:

certutil.exe
powershell.exe
cmd.exe
mshta.exe
rundll32.exe
regsvr32.exe
wscript.exe
cscript.exe

These are not malicious by themselves.

Context determines whether they're normal or suspicious.
